{"title":"Career Roadmap · 3D Modeller","role":"3D Modeller","summary":"A 3D Modeller creates digital three-dimensional assets for animation, games, films, advertising, VFX, product visualisation, architecture, AR/VR, and other digital experiences. The role combines 3D form development, topology, sculpting, UV mapping, texturing, optimisation, and production workflows.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Animation & Game Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Drawing, form, anatomy + 3D basics"}],[{"text":"Modelling"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Hard-surface + organic modelling"}],[{"text":"Production"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Texturing, UVs, optimisation + animation pipeline"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Specialisation + portfolio + internship"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior 3D Artist / 3D Modeller"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"3D Modeller / 3D Artist"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior 3D Artist / Specialist"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Lead 3D Artist / 3D Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Art Director / Creative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Drawing, Form & 3D Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals before focusing heavily on software."},{"type":"h","text":"Art fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Anatomy"},{"text":"Light and shadow"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Shape language"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Observation drawing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3D fundamentals"